  "comments": "The work is a mix of verses (43 verses of four lines each, v. 37 has five lines) and prose (expanding on the verses).\r\nThe text and manuscripts are described in [Q47PVAE6]: 75\u201376 and [A62SS59H].\r\nIt corresponds to the work listed by A khu ching as \"blo ldan shes rab kyi rnam thar bstod 'grel gro lung pas mdzad pa\" ([5RXEUKD9]: 507, No. 10903).",
  "alternative_names": "blo ldan shes rab gyi rnam thar\r\nbdag nyid chen po rngog lo tsa ba'i rnam par thar pa\r\nrngog lo tsa ba chen po'i rnam thar\r\nrngog lo tsA ba chen po'i rnam thar\r\nblo ldan shes rab kyi rnam par thar pa\r\nrngog rnam thar\r\nbla ma rje btsun dam pa gsang phu lo tsha ba chen po la bstod pa'i tshig le'ur byas pa\u2019i rnam par bshad pa",
